OL,3,ABritish national among six dead in
OL,4,Abuilding explosion close to Acropolis
OL,5,Ain Athens
OL,6,
OL,7,FPictures from the scene on Saturday
OL,8,Fshowed emergency service workers
OL,9,Fsearching through rubble, with a gas
OL,10,Fleak the suspected cause of the blast.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
